     'has ID policy for': \"RO\""@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000596> "Relates an ontology used to record id policy to the number of digits in the URI. The URI is: the 'has ID prefix\" annotation property value concatenated with an integer in the id range (left padded with \"0\"s to make this many digits)"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000117> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000596> "Person:Alan Ruttenberg"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000596> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/omo.owl>)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000596> "has ID digit count"@en)

