AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000117> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000600> "person:Alan Ruttenberg"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000600> "Person:Barry Smith"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000600> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000600> "Primitive terms in a highest-level ontology such as BFO are terms which are so basic to our understanding of reality that there is no way of defining them in a non-circular fashion. For these, therefore, we can provide only elucidations, supplemented by examples and by axioms"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000600> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/omo.owl>)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000600> "elucidation"@en)

