# Annotation Property: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OMO_0001001> (logical characteristic of object property)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OMO_0001001> "This is an annotation used on an object property to indicate a logical characterstic beyond what is possible in OWL.")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OMO_0001001> "OBO Operations call")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OMO_0001001> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/omo.owl>)
