# Annotation Property: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OMO_0003010> (International Nonproprietary Name)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000112> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OMO_0003010> "CHEBI:46195 has been assigned the english International Nonproproprietary Name (INN) \"paracetamol\". In some cases such as this one, the INN might be the same as the ontology's primary label")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OMO_0003010> "The International Nonproprietary Name (INN) is a standardize name for a pharmaceutical drug or active ingredient issued by the World Health Organization (WHO) meant to address the issues with country- or language-specific brand names. These are issued in several languages, including English, Latin, French, Russian, Spanish, Arabic, and Chinese.")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/created> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OMO_0003010> "2023-09-30"^^xsd:date)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasExactSynonym> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OMO_0003010> "INN")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:isDefinedBy <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OMO_0003010> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/omo.owl>)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OMO_0003010> "International Nonproprietary Name")
SubAnnotationPropertyOf(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OMO_0003010> <http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#SynonymTypeProperty>)

